{"title":"빛과 어둠의 동화","artist":"Sound Horizon","sourceId":"reference:nYMz5w7YPocRP0BPFAB6","sourceHash":"65d8eb7c7b0b060c7cbddf07bb481a01327ae1119a4fb237536744c8f04a9ed5","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":6865627,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.29,"end":7.17,"text":"Und nur die heis ist ubrig geblieben","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.21,"end":29.21,"text":"【Das Marchen des Licht und Dunkel(光と闇の童話)】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":33.2,"end":36.66,"text":"「そこ、足下に気をつけて」「うん」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":36.66,"end":39.14,"text":"「大丈夫？怖くないかい？」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":39.14,"end":43.79,"text":"「ええ。それより私 今とてもドキドキしているわ。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":43.79,"end":47.49,"text":"だって森は、世界は こんなに広いんですもの」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":47.49,"end":50.54,"text":"「じゃあ、今日はとっておきの場所を教えてあげるね。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":50.54,"end":56.01,"text":"「行こう！」「うん！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":56.01,"end":60.26,"text":"「うあぁぁぁああ！！」『3(ドライ) 2(ツヴァイ) 1(アインス)』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":60.26,"end":64.7,"text":"見上げれば 丸い夜空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":64.7,"end":69.37,"text":"揺らめく 蒼い月夜","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":69.37,"end":74.1,"text":"神の名を 呪いながら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":74.1,"end":78.89,"text":"奈落の 底で唄う...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":88.45,"end":92.5,"text":"盲(めし)いた 闇で 彼が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":92.5,"end":96.31,"text":"光だと 思っていたのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":96.31,"end":98.09,"text":"誤りで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":98.09,"end":101.72,"text":"その 温もりの名は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":101.72,"end":107.13,"text":"愛だと 後に知った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":107.13,"end":111.0,"text":"初めての 友達は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":111.0,"end":114.93,"text":"碧い瞳の 可愛い 女の子(メートヒェン)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":114.93,"end":116.66,"text":"お別れさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":116.66,"end":120.3,"text":"その 切なさの名が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":120.3,"end":128.12,"text":"恋だと 遂に知らず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":128.12,"end":132.72,"text":"花に 水を遣るように 儘(まま)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":132.72,"end":137.45,"text":"罪には 罰が要る 嗚呼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":137.45,"end":139.62,"text":"やがて《迎宵(グーテン･アーベント)》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":139.62,"end":142.06,"text":"疾(は)しる《第七の物語(ズィーベン･メルヒェン)》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":142.06,"end":145.3,"text":"摂理(かみ)に 背を向けて―『3(ドライ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":145.3,"end":148.69,"text":"2(ツヴァイ) 1(アインス)』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":148.69,"end":153.16,"text":"見下ろせば 昏(くら)い大地","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":153.16,"end":157.88,"text":"揺らめく 紅い焔尾(ほのお)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":157.88,"end":162.59,"text":"母の瞳に 抱かれながら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":162.59,"end":167.47,"text":"奈落の 底へ堕ちる...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":177.86,"end":181.95,"text":"「サビレタ村... マルデ墓場ネ... フフフ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":181.95,"end":186.14,"text":"「エリーゼ、童話は、何刻だって墓場から始まるものさ... 」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":186.14,"end":190.44,"text":"何故 コノ 村ニハ 今 誰モ イナイ ノ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":190.44,"end":195.14,"text":"―其れは 昔 皆 死んじゃった からさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":195.14,"end":199.79,"text":"ジャ... 何故 昔 村人 皆 死ン ジャッタ ノ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":199.79,"end":204.44,"text":"―其れは 黒き 死の病(やまい) のせいさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":204.44,"end":209.01,"text":"ジャ... 何故 ソノ 森ノ村ニ 母子(おやこ)ハ イタ ノ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":209.01,"end":213.77,"text":"―其れは 或(あ)の 【イド】が 呼んだ からさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":213.77,"end":218.32999999999998,"text":"ジャ... 何故 【イド】ハ 何ノ為ニ 人ヲ 呼ブ ノ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":218.32999999999998,"end":222.12,"text":"―其れこそが 奴の本能だからさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":222.12,"end":223.25,"text":"嗚呼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":223.25,"end":224.46,"text":"墓穴 掘っても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":224.46,"end":225.67000000000002,"text":"掘っても 掘っても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":225.67000000000002,"end":228.59,"text":"必死に 掘っても キリがない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":228.59,"end":232.18,"text":"「悲惨な時代さ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":232.18,"end":233.92000000000002,"text":"嗚呼 死体と土塊(つちくれ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":233.92000000000002,"end":236.13,"text":"死体と土塊(つちくれ) 死体と土塊","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":236.13,"end":238.09,"text":"多重菓子(ミルフィーユ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":238.09,"end":242.08,"text":"「無惨な事態さ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":242.08,"end":244.3,"text":"生命の目的は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":244.3,"end":246.7,"text":"《生キル事》と《増エル事》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":246.7,"end":249.07,"text":"殺セと 侵セと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":249.07,"end":254.64,"text":"【イド】は唄う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":254.64,"end":258.37,"text":"「増エスギテモ 結局、宿主ヲ殺シテ シマウノヨネ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":258.37,"end":263.13,"text":"「人と大地の関係と同じさ... さあ、 物語を続けようか」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":282.32,"end":284.36,"text":"夜露に濡れた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":284.36,"end":289.55,"text":"苔藻(こけも)を 踏み鳴らす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":289.55,"end":291.38,"text":"少年の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":291.38,"end":293.68,"text":"その足取りは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":293.68,"end":298.96,"text":"哀しい程に 軽く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":298.96,"end":300.67,"text":"少年を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":300.67,"end":302.97,"text":"呼び止めた 声は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":302.97,"end":305.23,"text":"下卑(げび)た 響きで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":305.23,"end":309.02,"text":"されど 彼はまだ 知らない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":309.02,"end":309.86,"text":"嗚呼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":309.86,"end":312.25,"text":"世界の 作為など","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":312.25,"end":314.48,"text":"世間の 悪意など","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":314.48,"end":319.26,"text":"何ひとつ 触れぬまま 育ったから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":319.26,"end":321.6,"text":"友達を 抱いたまま →","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":321.6,"end":323.82,"text":"招かざる 客を連れ →","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":323.82,"end":328.09,"text":"優しい 母の元へと → そして...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":328.09,"end":330.5,"text":"見渡せば―","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":379.94,"end":384.49,"text":"鳥に 羽が有るように 儘(まま)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":384.49,"end":389.06,"text":"夜には 唄が在る 嗚呼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":389.06,"end":391.44,"text":"いずれ《迎暁(グーテン モルゲン)》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":391.44,"end":393.77,"text":"染まる《薔薇の庭園(ローゼン ガルデン)》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":393.77,"end":396.97,"text":"摂理(かみ)を 背に受けて―『3(ドライ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":396.97,"end":400.35,"text":"2(ツヴァイ) 1(アインス)』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":400.35,"end":404.96,"text":"「君が今 笑っている、","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":404.96,"end":409.57,"text":"眩い 其の 時代に。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":409.57,"end":414.25,"text":"誰も恨まず、 死せることを 憾(うら)まず、","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":414.25,"end":418.97,"text":"必ず 其処で逢おう」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":418.97,"end":423.85,"text":"～『光と闇の 童話(メルヒェン)』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":447.92,"end":451.1,"text":"「第七の墓場 さあ、復讐劇の始まりだ」「アハハハハハ―」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}